 Decisions" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#253B73;fontStyle=1;" parent="0" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="27" y="1080" width="290" height="25" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="104" value="• Always run project + tool vector search&lt;br&gt;  (keeps pipeline consistent and cheap)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#16324F;fontStyle=0;" parent="0" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1115" width="285" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="105" value="• Carry forward only essential context&lt;br&gt;  (e.g. last 1–2 turns result summary:&lt;br&gt;  5 album names/IDs) — not full technical trace." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#16324F;fontStyle=0;" parent="0" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="335" y="1115" width="285" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="106" value="• Let the LLM decide if it’s a follow-up&lt;br&gt;  using conversation history (no separate classifier)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#16324F;fontStyle=0;" parent="0" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="1115" width="285" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="107" value="• Log each turn with structured data&lt;br&gt;  for future resolution (e.g. “who else is on that album?”)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#16324F;fontStyle=0;" parent="0" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="965" y="1115" width="300" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
